","start":115,"end":116,"surface":"穎","kind":"person","person_id":"e81_f09_000","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0124","start":124,"end":125,"surface":"志","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0135","start":135,"end":136,"surface":"越","kind":"person","person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0137","start":137,"end":138,"surface":"志","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0160","start":160,"end":161,"surface":"志","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0170","start":170,"end":172,"surface":"劉琨","kind":"person","person_id":"b21_e55_8bd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0178","start":178,"end":180,"surface":"劉粲","kind":"person","person_id":"d96_1fa_e9a_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0186","start":186,"end":187,"surface":"謐","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0188","start":188,"end":189,"surface":"詵","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBC","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0199","start":199,"end":200,"surface":"諶","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":64,"last_line":64,"revision_id":1775345},"source_quote":{"witness":"j44","quote":"　　及東海王越奉迎大駕，顒啟帝復穎還鄴，以志為魏郡太守，加左將軍，隨穎北鎮。行達洛陽，而平昌公模遣前鋒督護馮嵩距穎。穎還長安，未至而聞顒斬張方，求和於越。穎住華陰，志進長安，詣闕陳謝，即還就穎于武關。奔南陽，復為劉陶所驅，回詣河北。及穎薨，官屬奔散，唯志親自殯送，時人嘉之。越命志為軍諮祭酒，遷衛尉，永嘉末，轉尚書。洛陽沒，志將妻子北投并州刺史劉琨。至陽邑，為劉粲所虜，與次子謐、詵等俱遇害於平陽。長子諶。","raw_start":5238,"raw_end":5441,"raw_line":64},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-luzhi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yong:p006","text":"永嘉初，詔書以顒為司徒，乃就徵。南陽王模遣將梁臣于新安雍谷車上扼殺之，並其三子。詔以彭城元王植子融為顒嗣，改封樂成縣王。薨，無子。建興中，元帝又以彭城康王釋子欽為融嗣。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":180,"last_line":180,"raw_start":18628,"raw_end":18714,"raw_character_offsets":[18630,18631,18632,18633,18634,18635,18636,18637,18638,18639,18640,18641,18642,18643,18644,18645,18646,18647,18648,18649,18650,18651,18652,18653,18654,18655,18656,18657,18658,18659,18660,18661,18662,18663,18664,18665,18666,18667,18668,18669,18670,18671,18672,18673,18674,18675,18676,18677,18678,18679,18680,18681,18682,18683,18684,18685,18686,18687,18688,18689,18690,18691,18692,18693,18694,18695,18696,18697,18698,18699,18700,18701,18702,18703,18704,18705,18706,18707,18708,18709,18710,18711,18712,18713],"revision_id":2650517},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yong:p006:m0007","surface":"顒","start":7,"end":8,"person_id":"ed0_313_bea","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yong:p006:m0016","surface":"南陽王模","start":16,"end":20,"person_id":"a6t_8s4_3jz","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yong:p006:m0022","surface":"梁臣","start":22,"end":24,"person_id":"shw_qxl_se1","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yong:p006:m0042","surface":"彭城元王植","start":42,"end":47,"person_id":"i9a_dz0_c47","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yong:p006:m0048","surface":"融","start":48,"end":49,"person_id":"26c_kmn_v82","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yong:p006:m0050","surface":"顒","start":50,"end":51,"person_id":"ed0_313_bea","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yong:p006:m0069","surface":"元帝","start":69,"end":71,"person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yong:p006:m0073","surface":"彭城康王釋","start":73,"end":78,"person_id":"t89_cwg_wjl","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yong:p006:m0079","surface":"欽","start":79,"end":80,"person_id":"wra_rqn_hga","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yong","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-prince-yong-ws2650517"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-jiapi:p001","text":"賈疋，字彥度，武威人，魏太尉詡之曾孫也。少有志略，器望甚偉，見之者莫不悅附，特為武夫之所瞻仰，願為致命。初辟公府，遂曆顯職，遷安定太守。雍州刺史丁綽，貪橫失百姓心，乃譖疋于南陽王模，模以軍司謝班伐之。疋奔瀘水，與胡彭蕩仲及氐竇首結為兄弟，聚眾攻班。綽奔武都，疋復入安定，殺班。湣帝以疋為驃騎將軍、雍州刺史，封酒泉公。時諸郡百姓饑饉，白骨蔽野，百無一存。疋帥戎晉二萬餘人，將伐長安，西平太守竺恢亦固守，劉粲聞之，使劉曜、劉雅及趙染距疋，先攻恢，不克，疋邀擊，大敗之，曜中流矢，退走。疋追之，至於甘泉。旋自渭橋襲蕩仲，殺之。遂迎秦王，奉為皇太子。後蕩仲子夫護帥群胡攻之，疋敗走，夜墮於澗，為夫護所害。疋勇略有志節，以匡復晉室為己任，不幸顛墮，時人咸痛惜之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":129,"last_line":129,"raw_start":10717,"raw_end":11045,"raw_character_offsets":[10719,10720,10721,10722,10723,10724,10725,10726,10727,10728,10729,10730,10731,10732,10733,10734,10735,10736,10737,10738,10739,10740,10741,10742,10743,10744,10745,10746,10747,10748,10749,10750,10751,10752,10753,10754,10755,10756,10757,10758,10759,10760,10761,10762,10763,10764,10765,10766,10767,10768,10769,10770,10771,10772,10773,10774,10775,10776,10777,10778,10779,10780,10781,10782,10783,10784,10785,10786,10787,10788,10789,10790,10791,10792,10793,10794,10795,10796,10797,10798,10799,10800,10801,10802,10803,10804,10805,10806,10807,10808,10809,10810,10811,10812,10813,10814,10815,10816,10817,10818,10819,10820,10821,10822,10823,10824,10825,10826,10827,10828,10829,10830,10831,10832,10833,10834,10835,10836,10837,1083